hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1712","Narrated to us `Utbah ibn `Abdillah: narrated to us `Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak: narrated to us Mus`ab ibn Thabit: from Isma`il ibn Muhammad: from `Amir ibn Sa`d ibn Abi Waqqas: from his father (Sa`d ibn Abi Waqqas), who said:
*""I saw the Prophet (ﷺ) giving salam to his right and to his left until the whiteness of his cheek could be seen.""*

Az-Zuhri said: *""This was not heard from the hadith of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ).""*
Isma`il said: *""Have you heard two-thirds of the hadith of the Prophet (ﷺ)?""*
He said: *""No.""*
Isma`il said: *""Half of it?""*
He said: *""No.""*
Isma`il said: *""Then this is part of the half that you did not hear.""*

**CHAPTER:**"
